<div id="less-overview">
    <h1>LESS Component</h1>
    
    <p>DEPRECATED. Use SASS mixins and variables instead</p>

    <p>
        In comparison to past versions, Skin now offers a very minimal public
        <a href="https://lesscss.org/">
            LESS
        </a>
        ${" "}API (i.e. LESS variables and mixins). Over time this may be reduced to zero. This is due to the introduction of CSS Custom Properties, which give us many benefits over LESS variables in our token based system.
    </p>
    <p>
        Also, our Less module is
        <strong>not</strong>
         intended as a
        <em>general-purpose</em>
         library of utility mixins and variables such as
        <a href="https://lesshat.madebysource.com">
            LessHat
        </a>
         .
    </p>
</div>
